WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.560
Hey, I'm Andrew and I run the Offshore Audio

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.840
YouTube channel.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.240
Working with Tayyab has been an absolute pleasure

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:09.560
.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.050
Tayyab's edited videos for me for about eight

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:17.060
months at this point and has edited

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.330
some of my best performing videos with hundreds

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.200
of thousands of views across the channel.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.540
More importantly, he frees up so much space

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:29.780
in my head so that I can focus on just making

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.780
better videos.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.900
He's also been making thumbnails for the channel

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.120
.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.860
Again, some of the best performing videos,

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.600
highest click through rates that we've got

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.880
on the channel have been made by Tayyab.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.700
And again, one of the most important things

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.680
that Tayyab does is he always follows up, always

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.970
chases me for things that I say I'm going to

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.100
do and I never do.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.730
He's always delivering professionally, always

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.240
delivering on time, and it's just an absolute

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.240
pleasure to work with.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:57.500
So I could not recommend working with him,

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.920
whether it's for video editing or thumbnail

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:00.920
design.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.760
Couldn't recommend it more.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:05.240
Tayyab, thanks a lot.
